  "synopsis": "Yuu-hachi's Dekai Hachi; Miseban no Spis; and Aa, Tanuki wa Mou Dame desu manga all adapted into an omnibus short anime.\n\nDekai Hachi centers on a the titular character, a 40cm tall creature and his daily life alongside humans. Miseban no Spis centers on a mysterious fish that suddenly appears one day. Aa, Tanuki wa Mou Dame desu centers on a tanuki that is rented by various people.\n\n(Source: ANN, edited)",
